<title>PHILIPPINES: A Brown nine-month net 127.661 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>A Brown nine-month net 127.661 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property developer and chemical manufacturer A Brown Co Inc said on Monday it posted an unaudited net income of 127.661 million pesos in the first nine months of the year.</p>
<p>The company did not give comparative figures.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
